# Runtime state written by the agent runtime lives here and is NOT committed.
#
# `data/fixtures/` — committed, hand-authored, derived from the eval datasets.
# `data/state/`    — append-only JSONL written at runtime (runs, events,
#                    approvals, audit, incidents, paper orders, memory, traces).
#                    Delete it freely: it is evidence, not configuration.
*
!.gitignore
